cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Cite the Crane paper for the method. When using this independent implementation,
  also record the repository URL, exact commit and dependency environment.
type: software
title: "Crane: Independent Python Reproduction"
authors:
  - name: aHappend
repository-code: "https://github.com/aHappend/Crane"
url: "https://github.com/aHappend/Crane"
abstract: >-
  Independent Python research implementation of the Crane scheduling workflow
  for DNN inference and training on tiled architectures. Bundled experiments
  use proxy workloads; paper performance results are not validated reproductions.
keywords:
  - inter-layer scheduling
  - tiled architecture
  - DNN inference
  - training
  - reproducibility
  - mixed-integer programming
